<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank reverse repo drains 11 bln skr.</title>
<headline>Riksbank reverse repo drains 11 bln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riksbank said it drained 11 billion crowns from the market in this morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed rate of 4.10 percent and will run from February 5 to 12, replacing an operation that drained 16 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 2.83 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
